    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n3896" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀλγ-ηδών</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όνος</span>,
			ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>pain, suffering</i>, of body, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				5.18
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
